{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Chicken Up</i></strong> is a difficult, no, very difficult, game where a farmer, who wishes to remain anonymous, sets out on a journey to rescue his favorite chicken. Again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with his beloved pitchfork, He climbs a world so badly designed it must be on purpose, driven by love, pride, and questionable life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by a true story.<br>Or I think it is. Maybe you could check that for me?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your fork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s pretty much all you\u2019re going to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and you can slow down time.<br>Totally normal farmer stuff. But I thought the city folks should know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688840/extras/6f5f62f2163416b1fdeeb326639f95d6.poster.avif?t=1758737101\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688840/extras/6f5f62f2163416b1fdeeb326639f95d6.webm?t=1758737101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688840/extras/6f5f62f2163416b1fdeeb326639f95d6.mp4?t=1758737101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden easter eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth about this world. Or something like that, I never made it that far.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there <i>is</i> definitely a chicken at the top. Probably.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game made for a very specific kind of person.<br>To test them.<br>To humble them.<br>And to remind them what really matters: poultry.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688840?t=1758737101","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688840?t=1758737101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688840/8a38be40e207a983aa45a990acd96b26ce8efbe6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758737101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688840/8a38be40e207a983aa45a990acd96b26ce8efbe6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758737101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Chicken Up</i></strong> is a difficult, no, very difficult, game where a farmer, who wishes to remain anonymous, sets out on a journey to rescue his favorite chicken. Again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed only with his beloved pitchfork, He climbs a world so badly designed it must be on purpose, driven by love, pride, and questionable life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by a true story.<br>Or I think it is. Maybe you could check that for me?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your fork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump on it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s pretty much all you\u2019re going to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and you can slow down time.<br>Totally normal farmer stuff. But I t